# The Department of Revenue's page on the capital gains excise tax, which
# publishes each year's inflation-adjusted standard deduction (RCW 82.87.060,
# 82.87.150) and charitable deduction limits (RCW 82.87.080). The statute gives
# only the base amounts; these are the 2025 figures. No copy is kept.

